287
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:54,480
Settle down.

288
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:56,957
Just pretend you're resting
your hand in your pocket.

289
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:58,216
No one's gonna know.

290
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:03,820
More importantly, that bastard Jotaro
should arrive at the station any minute now.

291
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:06,492
As much as I'd like to get rid of Josuke,

292
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:09,366
we don't have time to
waste tracking him down.

293
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,310
Asamata!

294
00:17:11,393 --> 00:17:12,320
Wait for me!

295
