it to the meeting spot first.

312
00:18:17,020 --> 00:18:17,880
I win!

313
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,630
What the?

314
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:24,780
Look there!

315
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,962
