down to the fingerprints?

332
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,640
Yeah, it's crazy, right?

333
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:19,437
If he'd gotten to you before me and
Koichi, who knows what would have happened?

334
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,696
But at least, now we can relax a bit.

335
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:24,897
