ought to be easy to tell us apart.

336
00:19:24,980 --> 00:19:27,757
I had to think on my feet, but
figured that would be best.

337
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:29,546
Now we play the waiting game.

338
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:30,630
Got it.

339
